  "tests_added": [
    "Wrong names (including case-only changes), counts, units, sign, precision, negation and invented causes.",
    "Current-turn citations, wrong revision/ref/kind/ID, uncited claims and forbidden web citations for data.",
    "One repair versus bare-facts fallback, network failures, code-owned data grammar and Qwen-compatible decoding schema.",
    "Lowercase fact sentence boundaries, revision-bound result reads and zero-call selected fact follow-ups.",
    "Google success, bot check and unavailable responses; no credentials and no hidden graph context in queries.",
    "Input/explain/view/reply integration, evidence-event auditing and actual writer-call activity.",
    "Browser duplicate prevention, source inspection, reload persistence, safe web links/text, and 320/390/1200 pixel source layouts.",
    "Unresolved objective plus suggested operation remains a pending question and resumes the selected objective without another route.",
    "Two missing path endpoints, invalid endpoint replies, named endpoints, all-pairs defaults, and a source-to-all request; selected cards retain validated endpoint values.",
    "HTTP 403/429 Google responses stop retrieval without browser retries; source-backed status messages make no unsupported CAPTCHA claim.",
    "Dataset Studio accepts old captures and current grounded targets; changed claims, invented sources, duplicate sources and web-backed data answers are rejected."
  ],
